01:39:40,930 --> 01:39:43,370
Is this a pillar?

2235
01:39:43,370 --> 01:39:49,050
It's a pillar.

2236
01:39:49,050 --> 01:39:53,430
Did I see this one?

2237
01:39:53,430 --> 01:39:58,020
It's lonely.

2238
01:39:58,020 --> 01:40:02,340
Is everyone not delivering yet?

2239
01:40:02,340 --> 01:40:03,200
Not even the first spot?

2240
01:40:03,200 --> 01:40:08,610
Scary.

2241
01:40:08,610 --> 01:40:10,110
It's dark over here

2242
01:40:10,110 --> 01:40:17,970
Is this the third delivery spot?

2243
01:40:17,970 --> 01:40:23,220
Too high up

2244
01:40:23,220 --> 01:40:26,220
Should we deliver from this side?

2245
01:40:26,220 --> 01:40:28,720
What do you think?

2246
01:40:28,720 --> 01:40:33,620
Not interested in the small ones

2247
01:40:37,770 --> 01:40:38,890
The hole's broken

2248
01:40:38,890 --> 01:40:46,760
There it is!

2249
01:40:46,760 --> 01:40:48,260
Whoa, that startled me

2250
01:40:48,260 --> 01:40:50,360
Just now, I heard something

2251
01:40:50,360 --> 01:40:51,660
Oh, you heard a sound too?

2252
01:40:51,660 --> 01:40:52,660
Look, look, look!

2253
01:40:52,660 --> 01:40:54,660
Everyone thought Korone-senpai might have died

2254
01:40:54,660 --> 01:40:55,660
Oh, sorry, sorry!

2255
01:40:55,660 --> 01:40:57,160
I was carrying the big one, the big one!

2256
01:40:57,160 --> 01:40:59,160
Oh, thank you so much!

2257
01:40:59,160 --> 01:41:00,460
I need to report back to everyone

2258
01:41:00,460 --> 01:41:01,580
Oh good, good!

2259
01:41:01,580 --> 01:41:02,960
Sorry, sorry!

2260
01:41:02,960 --> 01:41:08,620
Sorry, sorry!

2261
01:41:08,620 --> 01:41:10,120
You came looking for me?

2262
01:41:10,120 --> 01:41:11,420
Why though?

2263
01:41:11,420 --> 01:41:13,220
Thank you, thank you!

2264
01:41:14,220 --> 01:41:17,860
What was that sound earlier? The shotgun guy?

2265
01:41:17,860 --> 01:41:23,590
Riona! Riona!

2266
01:41:23,590 --> 01:41:25,650
Blood! Blood!

2267
01:41:25,650 --> 01:41:27,170
I'm so happy!

2268
01:41:27,170 --> 01:41:31,860
Blood makes you happy, right? Blood is great!

2269
01:41:31,860 --> 01:41:33,810
It's still red, so that means...

2270
01:41:33,810 --> 01:41:37,850
The blood's still bright, so maybe it was just killed?

2271
01:41:37,850 --> 01:41:38,990
Yeah, probably

2272
01:41:38,990 --> 01:41:41,230
Drag it somewhere and come back again

2273
01:41:41,230 --> 01:41:41,850
Right, right

2274
01:41:41,850 --> 01:41:43,650
Oh, I see

2275
01:41:43,650 --> 01:41:45,300
Where did everyone go?

2276
01:41:45,300 --> 01:41:47,250
There they are, there they are! Found you!

2277
01:41:47,250 --> 01:41:49,050
Sorry, sorry!

2278
01:41:49,050 --> 01:41:51,050
Korone and I were trying to keep it upright

2279
01:41:51,050 --> 01:41:53,050
We had to do it like that

2280
01:41:53,050 --> 01:41:54,850
Yeah, yeah, yeah

2281
01:41:54,850 --> 01:41:56,850
Sorry, sorry!

2282
01:41:56,850 --> 01:41:58,860
Okay

2283
01:41:58,860 --> 01:42:00,860
Keep it upright, just like that

2284
01:42:00,860 --> 01:42:02,660
Help her while keeping it upright, Riona!

2285
01:42:02,660 --> 01:42:04,560
Riona, let's carry it together!

2286
01:42:04,560 --> 01:42:06,460
On my way!

2287
01:42:06,460 --> 01:42:08,260
Keep it standing upright

2288
01:42:08,260 --> 01:42:15,040
Let's pull it out first, pull it all the way out — once it's out we'll be fine

2289
01:42:15,040 --> 01:42:19,000
Is it stuck? Are we okay?

2290
01:42:19,000 --> 01:42:25,240
It's caught on something — what do we do?

2291
01:42:25,240 --> 01:42:29,700
This is tricky. Should we do it together?

2292
01:42:29,700 --> 01:42:34,120
Hold on, let's pull it — out, out, out!

2293
01:42:36,460 --> 01:42:42,500
If you push from below toward the top, it spins on you

2294
01:42:42,500 --> 01:42:44,020
Got it

2295
01:42:44,020 --> 01:42:46,060
Here we go

2296
01:42:46,060 --> 01:42:50,020
Forget it, let's just go straight

2297
01:42:50,020 --> 01:42:51,460
Okay, go go go go!

2298
01:42:51,460 --> 01:42:55,760
Oh no, this is bad

2299
01:42:55,760 --> 01:42:57,220
Can't do it?

2300
01:42:57,220 --> 01:42:57,720
Yeah

2301
01:42:57,720 --> 01:42:59,720
Might be impossible — whatever, let's back off for now

2302
01:42:59,720 --> 01:43:02,520
This is bad

2303
01:43:03,900 --> 01:43:05,900
It's fine, it's fine! Don't worry, don't worry!

2304
01:43:05,900 --> 01:43:08,200
Oh, a small one came

2305
01:43:08,200 --> 01:43:10,000
Oh wait, it's working, it's working!

2306
01:43:10,000 --> 01:43:11,000
Oh!

2307
01:43:11,000 --> 01:43:12,300
There we go!

2308
01:43:12,300 --> 01:43:14,100
Okay, okay!

2309
01:43:14,100 --> 01:43:14,900
Alright!

2310
01:43:14,900 --> 01:43:18,700
Oh, thanks for the muscle boost! Thank you, thank you!

2311
01:43:18,700 --> 01:43:21,700
I think the clock might have gotten broken

2312
01:43:21,700 --> 01:43:22,500
It got broken?

2313
01:43:22,500 --> 01:43:23,000
What?

2314
01:43:23,000 --> 01:43:23,800
Yeah

2315
01:43:23,800 --> 01:43:27,100
The total value dropped a lot — it got broken

2316
01:43:27,100 --> 01:43:31,200
Well, things break sometimes, it happens

2317
01:43:31,620 --> 01:43:35,500
It's totally fine! Totally fine!

2318
01:43:35,500 --> 01:43:38,100
We'll just make another one!

2319
01:43:38,100 --> 01:43:40,880
We'll just make another clock!

2320
01:43:40,880 --> 01:43:46,500
It's the big tall grandfather clock after all!

2321
01:43:46,500 --> 01:43:53,060
Hey Matsuri, over here—

2322
01:43:53,060 --> 01:43:56,900
the delivery spot is on the right side here,

2323
01:43:56,900 --> 01:43:58,700
but I think there's another one further in.

2324
01:43:58,700 --> 01:44:00,500
Shouldn't we go there first?

2325
01:44:00,500 --> 01:44:03,300
Should we start from the back?

2326
01:44:03,300 --> 01:44:04,300
Okay, okay!

2327
01:44:04,300 --> 01:44:06,100
Okay~!

2328
01:44:06,100 --> 01:44:06,900
Okay~!

2329
01:44:06,900 --> 01:44:08,700
Roger, heading to the back.

2330
01:44:08,700 --> 01:44:10,700
Is there anything here? Anything?

2331
01:44:10,700 --> 01:44:12,500
La la la la la~

2332
01:44:12,500 --> 01:44:14,300
Anything good here?

2333
01:44:14,300 --> 01:44:16,100
Anything?

2334
01:44:16,100 --> 01:44:17,100
There's something more over here.

2335
01:44:17,100 --> 01:44:17,900
Sweet!

2336
01:44:17,900 --> 01:44:18,900
Sweet!

2337
01:44:18,900 --> 01:44:20,700
You'll fall off here.

2338
01:44:20,700 --> 01:44:24,130
Oh, looks like we haven't been here yet.

2339
01:44:25,130 --> 01:44:26,930
We haven't gone this way, right?

2340
01:44:26,930 --> 01:44:36,290
Hey, isn't this like a trap?

2341
01:44:36,290 --> 01:44:41,730
Like, can we even walk here?

2342
01:44:41,730 --> 01:44:44,990
It should be fine, right?

2343
01:44:44,990 --> 01:44:47,790
You think we'll slip and fall if we walk here?

2344
01:44:47,790 --> 01:44:52,390
We might fall, yeah.

2345
01:44:52,390 --> 01:44:54,190
Let's not risk it.

2346
01:44:56,790 --> 01:44:57,830
Found something!

2347
01:44:57,830 --> 01:44:59,070
A doll!

2348
01:44:59,070 --> 01:45:00,390
A stuffed animal!

2349
01:45:00,390 --> 01:45:02,230
Oh no oh no oh no!

2350
01:45:02,230 --> 01:45:04,230
Over here, this one!

2351
01:45:04,230 --> 01:45:05,830
Scary, scary!

2352
01:45:05,830 --> 01:45:07,390
This place is so scary!

2353
01:45:07,390 --> 01:45:08,190
Scary!

2354
01:45:08,190 --> 01:45:09,590
Let's get out of here, this is where it starts!

2355
01:45:09,590 --> 01:45:10,310
This place is so scary!

2356
01:45:10,310 --> 01:45:10,870
Let's go back, let's go back!

2357
01:45:10,870 --> 01:45:12,270
Way too scary!

2358
01:45:12,270 --> 01:45:14,070
Let's regroup with everyone!

2359
01:45:14,070 --> 01:45:15,510
You okay?

2360
01:45:15,510 --> 01:45:16,110
Hey Matsuri, this place—

2361
01:45:16,110 --> 01:45:18,230
there was a huge bottomless pit here!

2362
01:45:18,230 --> 01:45:19,990
This place is scary!

2363
01:45:19,990 --> 01:45:21,830
Oh, Scott!

2364
01:45:21,830 --> 01:45:23,870
Should we go this way?

2365
01:45:23,870 --> 01:45:26,850
Oh, we can go! We can go!

2366
01:45:26,850 --> 01:45:29,450
Nothing here. Nothing?

2367
01:45:29,450 --> 01:45:31,850
This place is way too scary.

2368
01:45:31,850 --> 01:45:34,870
Scary, scary!

2369
01:45:34,870 --> 01:45:37,310
It's level 5, so there are a lot of holes.

2370
01:45:37,310 --> 01:45:40,990
Ah, I see. There might be spots we haven't checked yet.

2371
01:45:40,990 --> 01:45:42,890
Why though?

2372
01:45:42,890 --> 01:45:45,190
Hey senpai, did you find that doll earlier?

2373
01:45:45,190 --> 01:45:46,390
Hm?

2374
01:45:46,390 --> 01:45:48,150
Okay, shh, keep it secret!

2375
01:45:48,150 --> 01:45:49,090
Oh, secret!

2376
01:45:49,090 --> 01:45:50,030
Wait, did you drop it?

2377
01:45:50,030 --> 01:45:51,390
You okay? Hey, hey!

2378
01:45:51,390 --> 01:45:53,690
Ahahahaha! Hey! Hey! Knock it off!

2379
01:45:53,690 --> 01:45:54,500
Isn't that the doll?

2380
01:45:54,500 --> 01:45:55,490
Isn't that the doll? Right? Right?

2381
01:45:55,490 --> 01:45:57,490
The fact that Korone dropped the doll is a secret, okay? Got it?

2382
01:45:57,490 --> 01:45:58,490
Ahahahahaha!

2383
01:45:58,490 --> 01:46:00,290
You dropped the doll?

2384
01:46:00,290 --> 01:46:02,090
See! It's Riona! You idiot!

2385
01:46:02,090 --> 01:46:04,090
No no no! I messed up!

2386
01:46:04,090 --> 01:46:09,770
I said something dumb!

2387
01:46:09,770 --> 01:46:11,770
I'm such an idiot!

2388
01:46:11,770 --> 01:46:14,570
Anything over there?

2389
01:46:14,570 --> 01:46:17,420
Doesn't look like it? Nothing?

2390
01:46:17,420 --> 01:46:19,170
Hmm, probably not.

2391
01:46:19,170 --> 01:46:24,210
Alright then, let's block it off. Okay okay okay.

2392
01:46:24,210 --> 01:46:32,170
Okay~ Alright, where does this go, everyone head to the back—

2393
01:46:32,170 --> 01:46:35,190
Time!

2394
01:46:35,190 --> 01:46:40,990
Feels like we're almost done— oh, watch out!

2395
01:46:40,990 --> 01:46:44,970
If you run too fast you'll fall right off, huh.

2396
01:46:44,970 --> 01:46:46,970
- Think we're okay? - I'll go ahead and deliver here.

2397
01:46:46,970 --> 01:46:47,970
Okay!

2398
01:46:47,970 --> 01:46:51,320
- Yeah, okay! - Over here.

2399
01:46:51,320 --> 01:46:53,320
- Okay! - Oh, I'm showing you, I'm showing you!

2400
01:46:53,320 --> 01:46:55,040
There's a hole here!

2401
01:46:55,040 --> 01:46:56,720
- Huh, where? - Here here here here here!

2402
01:46:56,720 --> 01:46:58,720
- Fell, fell! - 40,000 yen? Amazing!

2403
01:46:58,720 --> 01:46:59,720
- Watch out! - Watch out!

2404
01:46:59,720 --> 01:47:01,720
- Watch out! - Nice!

2405
01:47:01,720 --> 01:47:03,600
That was close!

2406
01:47:03,600 --> 01:47:06,400
Oh, praise them — just now, at the end—

2407
01:47:06,400 --> 01:47:08,400
- It's coming out! - Over by the farm area!

2408
01:47:08,400 --> 01:47:09,400
- Oh, you knew? - It's a fossil, right?

2409
01:47:09,400 --> 01:47:11,220
- Yay yay yay! - We did it!

2410
01:47:11,220 --> 01:47:13,000
That's amazing!

2411
01:47:13,000 --> 01:47:15,000
Woohoo~!

2412
01:47:15,000 --> 01:47:20,600
Yes~!

2413
01:47:20,600 --> 01:47:22,600
Should we explore a bit more?

2414
01:47:22,600 --> 01:47:24,400
Should we just go deliver already?

2415
01:47:24,400 --> 01:47:26,400
There's one more spot underground we haven't checked.

2416
01:47:26,400 --> 01:47:28,400
Oh, okay okay!

2417
01:47:28,400 --> 01:47:30,400
Oh, there's one!

2418
01:47:30,400 --> 01:47:32,200
It's coming — it's right here!

2419
01:47:32,200 --> 01:47:33,800
It's right here! Ow!

2420
01:47:33,800 --> 01:47:35,600
Ow!

2421
01:47:35,600 --> 01:47:37,600
That was close!

2422
01:48:10,660 --> 01:48:11,660
OK!

2423
01:48:11,660 --> 01:48:13,660
We shouldn't deliver yet, right?

2424
01:48:13,660 --> 01:48:15,960
Right, like this area here—

2425
01:48:15,960 --> 01:48:16,460
Let me check...

2426
01:48:16,460 --> 01:48:18,460
Oh, sorry sorry sorry sorry sorry sorry sorry!

2427
01:48:18,460 --> 01:48:19,960
An Angyul is here!

2428
01:48:19,960 --> 01:48:20,960
Aaah!

2429
01:48:20,960 --> 01:48:21,960
Angyul!

2430
01:48:21,960 --> 01:48:22,770
Ow!

2431
01:48:22,770 --> 01:48:24,260
Ow!

2432
01:48:24,260 --> 01:48:25,460
Let's run!

2433
01:48:25,460 --> 01:48:26,860
What a rowdy little thing!

2434
01:48:26,860 --> 01:48:28,860
Oh no, we can't let it break the valuables!

2435
01:48:28,860 --> 01:48:29,860
What an energetic one!

2436
01:48:29,860 --> 01:48:32,140
You okay?

2437
01:48:32,140 --> 01:48:32,960
Really?

2438
01:48:32,960 --> 01:48:34,760
Just leave it in your hands.

2439
01:48:34,760 --> 01:48:37,360
Let's check here one more time.

2440
01:48:37,360 --> 01:48:39,960
Let's do a double check.

2441
01:48:39,960 --> 01:48:41,400
Double checking is important.

2442
01:48:41,400 --> 01:48:43,160
It really is.

2443
01:48:43,160 --> 01:48:46,800
Is there anything here?

2444
01:48:46,800 --> 01:48:52,030
Nothing left?

2445
01:48:52,030 --> 01:48:54,110
Nothing here.

2446
01:48:54,110 --> 01:49:00,290
Such a huge mansion and there's nothing?

2447
01:49:00,290 --> 01:49:06,590
Maybe the owner already moved out.

2448
01:49:06,590 --> 01:49:07,690
Nothing.

2449
01:49:07,690 --> 01:49:12,290
You know, those green lamps always look like crane fly series to me.

2450
01:49:12,290 --> 01:49:15,190
But they're not, right?

2451
01:49:15,190 --> 01:49:22,720
Are there any spots we haven't checked yet?

2452
01:49:22,720 --> 01:49:23,900
Got it.

2453
01:49:23,900 --> 01:49:25,320
Let's head that way.

2454
01:49:25,320 --> 01:49:29,860
I'm getting scared, I wonder why.

2455
01:49:29,860 --> 01:49:30,690
Something...

2456
01:49:30,690 --> 01:49:32,730
Wait, what? Why is this so scary?

2457
01:49:32,730 --> 01:49:36,690
I'm getting scared.

2458
01:49:36,690 --> 01:49:45,530
Oh, scary.

2459
01:49:45,530 --> 01:49:47,330
Oh, it's still over there.

2460
01:49:47,330 --> 01:49:49,330
It's standing right there!

2461
01:49:49,330 --> 01:49:51,130
It looks like a glacier!

2462
01:49:51,130 --> 01:49:52,930
A glacier?

2463
01:49:52,930 --> 01:49:59,350
Oh, nice nice!

2464
01:49:59,350 --> 01:50:01,350
Yeah!

2465
01:50:01,350 --> 01:50:03,150
Yeah!

2466
01:50:03,150 --> 01:50:04,950
Haven't we gone to the basement on this side?

2467
01:50:04,950 --> 01:50:06,890
Oh, this way?

2468
01:50:06,890 --> 01:50:10,560
Is this the middle area?

2469
01:50:10,560 --> 01:50:12,160
Yeah.

2470
01:50:12,160 --> 01:50:13,960
OK.

2471
01:50:13,960 --> 01:50:15,760
Are we still looking?

2472
01:50:15,760 --> 01:50:17,560
Still looking.

2473
01:50:17,560 --> 01:50:18,360
Still looking.

2474
01:50:18,360 --> 01:50:20,160
Where are they?

2475
01:50:20,160 --> 01:50:23,220
Shuttle 1.

2476
01:50:23,220 --> 01:50:25,860
This side?

2477
01:50:25,860 --> 01:50:27,400
This way?

2478
01:50:27,400 --> 01:50:28,260
This side too.

2479
01:50:28,260 --> 01:50:29,200
Oh, wait a sec!

2480
01:50:29,200 --> 01:50:44,450
Wait a sec!

2481
01:50:44,450 --> 01:50:46,250
It's disaster victim Thomas!

2482
01:50:46,250 --> 01:50:49,050
So very Thomas

2483
01:50:49,050 --> 01:50:51,850
That scared me!

2484
01:50:51,850 --> 01:50:53,650
Okay, that's fine

2485
01:50:53,650 --> 01:50:54,650
Is there nothing left?

2486
01:50:54,650 --> 01:50:55,650
Looks like there's nothing

2487
01:50:55,650 --> 01:50:56,650
Okay

2488
01:50:59,810 --> 01:51:05,810
I'm counting on you

2489
01:51:05,810 --> 01:51:07,750
Got it, leave it to me

2490
01:51:07,750 --> 01:51:17,440
Riona, come here

2491
01:51:17,440 --> 01:51:18,700
Yes!

2492
01:51:18,700 --> 01:51:21,060
Let's try carrying this, Riona

2493
01:51:21,060 --> 01:51:22,760
Together, okay?

2494
01:51:22,760 --> 01:51:23,880
Is that a dinosaur?

2495
01:51:23,880 --> 01:51:24,780
It's a little dinosaur!

2496
01:51:24,780 --> 01:51:25,760
Yes!

2497
01:51:25,760 --> 01:51:28,360
Hold the base at the bottom

2498
01:51:28,360 --> 01:51:29,960
Okay!

2499
01:51:29,960 --> 01:51:31,960
Heave-ho! Drag drag drag!

2500
01:51:31,960 --> 01:51:33,760
Drag drag drag!

2501
01:51:33,760 --> 01:51:35,760
Heave-ho! Nice! Nice!

2502
01:51:35,760 --> 01:51:37,760
We did it! We did it!

2503
01:51:37,760 --> 01:51:39,410
Let's head back!

2504
01:51:39,410 --> 01:51:41,160
Let's go back! Let's go home!

2505
01:51:41,160 --> 01:51:42,960
Alright! Let's go home! Let's go!

2506
01:51:42,960 --> 01:51:44,760
This is scary...

2507
01:51:44,760 --> 01:51:46,560
Scary!

2508
01:51:46,560 --> 01:51:48,360
Watame, is your health okay?

2509
01:51:48,360 --> 01:51:50,360
I'm fine! I have 100!

2510
01:51:50,360 --> 01:51:52,160
Okay, Gaoji is heading back

2511
01:51:52,160 --> 01:51:53,960
Isn't that amazing?

2512
01:51:53,960 --> 01:51:56,760
This is so great! So great!

2513
01:51:56,760 --> 01:51:57,760
Good good!

2514
01:51:57,760 --> 01:51:59,420
Let's go! Let's go!

2515
01:51:59,420 --> 01:52:01,360
Let's go now! Now!

2516
01:52:01,360 --> 01:52:02,360
Oh no oh no oh no!

2517
01:52:02,360 --> 01:52:03,360
What what what?

2518
01:52:03,360 --> 01:52:05,160
It's an animal! It's an animal!

2519
01:52:05,160 --> 01:52:06,760
I took it down!

2520
01:52:06,760 --> 01:52:08,760
Yes!

2521
01:52:08,760 --> 01:52:11,560
Souvenir! Souvenir!

2522
01:52:11,560 --> 01:52:12,560
We did it!

2523
01:52:12,560 --> 01:52:14,360
We did it!

2524
01:52:14,360 --> 01:52:15,360
Nice!

2525
01:52:15,360 --> 01:52:18,160
That's great! That's great!

2526
01:52:19,150 --> 01:52:22,760
What a waste, it's a waste but can't be helped

2527
01:52:22,760 --> 01:52:24,760
We can't carry it back, right, yeah

2528
01:52:24,760 --> 01:52:26,760
I see. It came back again!

2529
01:52:26,760 --> 01:52:36,760
So persistent, that thing's the only one here

2530
01:52:36,760 --> 01:52:38,760
Is this the last one?

2531
01:52:38,760 --> 01:52:42,360
Okay, time-wise

2532
01:52:42,360 --> 01:52:45,360
I want to clear it. There's a Wizard Drone, right?

2533
01:52:45,360 --> 01:52:47,160
Which one?

2534
01:52:47,160 --> 01:52:49,960
You know, the drone with angel wings

2535
01:52:49,960 --> 01:52:51,760
That's nice

2536
01:52:51,760 --> 01:52:56,560
It's the one that lets you carry things super easily even without the Strength upgrade

2537
01:52:56,560 --> 01:52:57,560
Oh really?

2538
01:52:57,560 --> 01:52:58,480
I see

2539
01:52:58,480 --> 01:52:59,360
That sounds great

2540
01:52:59,360 --> 01:53:01,160
You're carrying something dangerous

2541
01:53:01,160 --> 01:53:02,960
Look

2542
01:53:02,960 --> 01:53:03,760
Mom, don't...

2543
01:53:03,760 --> 01:53:05,760
We might not need it if we have Korone

2544
01:53:05,760 --> 01:53:07,760
Mom, don't...

2545
01:53:07,760 --> 01:53:11,760
Honestly, if you have the Strength upgrade, you don't need this drone

2546
01:53:11,760 --> 01:53:13,380
Oh, so we don't need it then?

2547
01:53:13,380 --> 01:53:15,240
Mom, should we buy a frying pan?

2548
01:53:15,240 --> 01:53:17,240
Mom already has tons of frying pans

2549
01:53:17,240 --> 01:53:19,240
Let's concentrate all the Strength on Korone

2550
01:53:19,240 --> 01:53:21,040
Yay!

2551
01:53:21,040 --> 01:53:23,040
Potato, potato

2552
01:53:23,040 --> 01:53:25,040
Potato

2553
01:53:25,040 --> 01:53:26,840
What is this

2554
01:53:26,840 --> 01:53:28,640
This is bad

2555
01:53:28,640 --> 01:53:30,640
The frying pan is for hitting other people

2556
01:53:30,640 --> 01:53:32,640
Ow, ow ow

2557
01:53:32,640 --> 01:53:34,440
I never raised you to be like this

2558
01:53:34,440 --> 01:53:36,240
I'm sorry, Mom

2559
01:53:36,240 --> 01:53:38,040
I don't know, I don't know

2560
01:53:38,040 --> 01:53:40,400
Oh, what? It exploded

2561
01:53:40,720 --> 01:53:42,720
Ow, that hurts!

2562
01:53:42,720 --> 01:53:45,520
Damn it! What is this?

2563
01:53:45,320 --> 01:53:54,540
Thank you for watching!

2564
01:53:54,360 --> 01:53:57,500
This is so cruel! Seriously!

2565
01:53:57,500 --> 01:54:01,060
Amazing! Don't say that!

2566
01:54:01,060 --> 01:54:01,900
What was that?

2567
01:54:01,900 --> 01:54:02,700
It's a potato!

2568
01:54:02,700 --> 01:54:03,700
Thank you!

2569
01:54:03,700 --> 01:54:04,700
Something was broken!

2570
01:54:04,700 --> 01:54:06,500
Huh?

2571
01:54:07,300 --> 01:54:11,200
Wow! We bought so much and still got change back!

2572
01:54:11,200 --> 01:54:14,100
Amazing!

2573
01:54:14,100 --> 01:54:23,500
See, we're done shopping!

2574
01:54:23,500 --> 01:54:26,100
Alright kids, let's go!

2575
01:54:26,100 --> 01:54:28,900
Going in!

2576
01:54:28,900 --> 01:54:31,700
No! Don't shoplift!

2577
01:54:31,700 --> 01:54:34,700
No! Don't bring that in!

2578
01:54:38,330 --> 01:54:40,130
Watchon, Watchon!

2579
01:54:40,130 --> 01:54:42,630
Okay, so Watame takes the Power upgrade.

2580
01:54:42,630 --> 01:54:44,630
Got it.

2581
01:54:44,630 --> 01:54:47,930
And if anyone wants HP, feel free to take it.

2582
01:54:47,930 --> 01:54:49,920
Anyone want HP?

2583
01:54:49,920 --> 01:54:51,730
Me! Me!

2584
01:54:51,730 --> 01:54:53,330
Me!

2585
01:54:53,330 --> 01:54:55,330
Okay, go ahead and take the HP.

2586
01:54:55,330 --> 01:54:56,330
Nice!

2587
01:54:56,330 --> 01:54:57,630
Oh, that's not it!

2588
01:54:57,630 --> 01:54:58,930
Oh, that's not it either!

2589
01:54:58,930 --> 01:55:01,230
This is the green one.

2590
01:55:01,230 --> 01:55:03,230
The green one — edamame, edamame!

2591
01:55:03,230 --> 01:55:05,230
Itadakimasu! Edamame!

2592
01:55:05,530 --> 01:55:09,510
No! Speed, speed, speed! It's the one that makes you super fast!

2593
01:55:09,510 --> 01:55:15,500
There are three of them — they make you faster. But if you're fast...

2594
01:55:15,500 --> 01:55:23,730
...if you run while carrying loot, you'll crash into it and break it, so it's not great. People who tend to run should be careful.

2595
01:55:23,730 --> 01:55:27,410
If you run a lot it might be a problem. I run a lot too. Guess I'll take it then!

2596
01:55:27,410 --> 01:55:32,390
It makes you super fast! Amazing! Anyone else want one?

2597
01:55:32,390 --> 01:55:34,950
I want one! Go ahead!

2598
01:55:34,950 --> 01:55:37,110
Alright! Good, good.

2599
01:55:37,110 --> 01:55:39,850
Let's go! Let's go!

2600
01:55:39,850 --> 01:55:44,930
Watch Matsuri's starting dash! I'm watching! Let's go!

2601
01:55:44,930 --> 01:55:48,830
Let's go, let's go, let's go! Last one — Level 6!

2602
01:55:48,830 --> 01:55:50,110
Let's do our best!

2603
01:55:50,110 --> 01:55:53,410
Fast, fast, fast!

2604
01:55:53,410 --> 01:55:58,090
Whoa, too fast!

2605
01:55:58,090 --> 01:56:02,730
Yeah, that was amazing! It's fine, it's fine!

2606
01:56:02,730 --> 01:56:06,350
That was lightning fast! They're already carrying stuff in!

2607
01:56:06,350 --> 01:56:11,730
Maybe Korone's Power is at 4 now? Yeah, she's absolutely jacked!

2608
01:56:11,730 --> 01:56:17,420
Oh, be careful not to fall in the hole! Got it!

2609
01:56:17,420 --> 01:56:22,920
The big ones should be brought to the entrance first.

2610
01:56:22,920 --> 01:56:26,590
Over here!

2611
01:56:26,590 --> 01:56:29,030
Would you like that warmed up?

2612
01:56:29,030 --> 01:56:32,450
Would you like chopsticks with— oh, sorry, never mind.

2613
01:56:32,450 --> 01:56:34,350
Oh, is it a bento?

2614
01:56:34,350 --> 01:56:39,420
I was just barely in earshot for that.

2615
01:56:39,420 --> 01:56:43,750
When you find a big one, just carry it as-is.

2616
01:56:43,750 --> 01:56:45,950
Okay!

2617
01:56:45,950 --> 01:56:47,950
We just carry it without putting it in, right?

2618
01:56:47,950 --> 01:56:51,430
Awakening...

2619
01:56:52,590 --> 01:56:57,530
That'd be surprising. Okay.

2620
01:56:57,530 --> 01:57:00,930
Nothing here.

2621
01:57:00,930 --> 01:57:19,350
Wait, this guy's here — oh, we're saved! That was close!

2622
01:57:19,350 --> 01:57:25,250
That's dangerous! This one, this one — you throw it like this, see?

2623
01:57:25,250 --> 01:57:27,550
That'll explode! Be careful!

2624
01:57:27,550 --> 01:57:29,870
Got it.

2625
01:57:29,870 --> 01:57:35,920
But my HP didn't go down.

2626
01:57:35,920 --> 01:57:37,890
Where was it?

2627
01:57:37,890 --> 01:57:40,690
You're right!

2628
01:57:40,690 --> 01:57:42,690
This thing is such an idiot!

2629
01:57:42,690 --> 01:57:47,290
Yay!

2630
01:57:47,290 --> 01:57:48,290
I see.

2631
01:57:48,290 --> 01:57:51,590
Is there a big one ahead that we can't get past?

2632
01:57:51,590 --> 01:57:52,590
A big one?

2633
01:57:52,590 --> 01:57:55,010
Leave it to me! I'll take it!

2634
01:57:55,010 --> 01:57:58,260
This one's gonna be a pain to carry again, isn't it?

2635
01:57:58,260 --> 01:58:00,930
If you bump into it, you'll go flying, so be careful!

2636
01:58:00,930 --> 01:58:01,930
What?!

2637
01:58:01,930 --> 01:58:05,230
It's like a broom, a broom!

2638
01:58:05,230 --> 01:58:07,530
If you lose the box, you'll go flying!

2639
01:58:07,530 --> 01:58:08,830
Got it.

2640
01:58:08,830 --> 01:58:11,130
Well, I think you'll be fine if you have a drone attached to it.

2641
01:58:11,130 --> 01:58:12,730
Got it, I'll carry it!

2642
01:58:12,730 --> 01:58:14,330
Okay!

2643
01:58:14,330 --> 01:58:20,030
Every day, every day, we're out here working~

2644
01:58:20,030 --> 01:58:21,430
This way, this way?

2645
01:58:21,430 --> 01:58:22,690
Heave-ho!

2646
01:58:22,690 --> 01:58:25,430
Good thing it was close by!

2647
01:58:25,430 --> 01:58:27,230
But this one...

2648
01:58:27,230 --> 01:58:29,830
Is it okay to put it in?

2649
01:58:29,830 --> 01:58:31,630
It's fine, it's fine!

2650
01:58:31,630 --> 01:58:47,500
Alright then—

2651
01:58:47,500 --> 01:58:50,300
What are you doing?!

2652
01:58:50,300 --> 01:58:53,730
Stop laughing!

2653
01:58:53,730 --> 01:58:57,530
Ugh, it was fine the way it was before!

2654
01:58:57,530 --> 01:58:59,380
Damn it!

2655
01:58:59,380 --> 01:59:07,520
I said stop laughing!

2656
01:59:07,520 --> 01:59:09,520
Should we take this one over there?

2657
01:59:09,520 --> 01:59:12,370
You okay?

2658
01:59:12,370 --> 01:59:16,160
You okay?

2659
01:59:16,160 --> 01:59:22,830
I want to angle it in, Watame, with this one.

2660
01:59:22,830 --> 01:59:23,830
Got it!

2661
01:59:23,830 --> 01:59:25,630
I'll hold it steady!

2662
01:59:25,630 --> 01:59:26,540
Thank you!

2663
01:59:26,540 --> 01:59:28,430
Stop laughing!

2664
01:59:28,430 --> 01:59:31,030
Thank you, thank you!

2665
01:59:31,030 --> 01:59:32,030
Nice, nice!

2666
01:59:32,030 --> 01:59:32,830
We did it!

2667
01:59:32,830 --> 01:59:34,630
We did it, thank goodness!

2668
01:59:34,630 --> 01:59:36,630
Nice! Thanks! Great teamwork!

2669
01:59:36,630 --> 01:59:40,000
So we just put this in here later, right? Okay!

2670
01:59:40,000 --> 01:59:42,280
Nice, nice!

2671
01:59:42,280 --> 01:59:44,100
Pen!

2672
01:59:44,100 --> 01:59:46,560
Oh!

2673
01:59:47,160 --> 01:59:49,160
Ohhh!

2674
01:59:49,160 --> 01:59:55,360
Nice! Clean, clean!

2675
01:59:55,360 --> 02:00:01,600
Oh, uh oh!

2676
02:00:01,400 --> 02:00:03,860
You only do amazing things, don't you!

2677
02:00:03,860 --> 02:00:05,660
Otaku core!

2678
02:00:05,660 --> 02:00:10,970
Huh?

2679
02:00:10,970 --> 02:00:12,630
Did you push it?

2680
02:00:13,230 --> 02:00:26,770
I'm not interested in the small ones!

2681
02:00:26,770 --> 02:00:33,250
Small... I'm not interested in small bodies!

2682
02:00:33,250 --> 02:00:39,690
Fussing around with tiny stuff~

2683
02:00:39,690 --> 02:00:41,690
Just carry the small ones~

2684
02:00:41,690 --> 02:00:44,490
I'm not interested!

2685
02:00:44,490 --> 02:00:52,270
You could propose with that!

2686
02:00:52,270 --> 02:00:55,070
That one's definitely big, for sure.

2687
02:00:55,070 --> 02:00:59,070
Oh, nothing... found one!

2688
02:01:05,110 --> 02:01:09,590
Taking this — Apprentice Project Phazer!

2689
02:01:09,590 --> 02:01:12,300
Phanger!

2690
02:01:12,300 --> 02:01:19,400
Phanger!

2691
02:01:19,400 --> 02:01:29,250
Phanger, phanger, phanger — it'll be bad if it gets thrown in!

2692
02:01:29,250 --> 02:01:32,550
Rain!

2693
02:01:32,510 --> 02:01:40,510
I can't stop kicking when I think of this question. I can't recall this situation.

2694
02:01:40,510 --> 02:01:54,510
This is seriously impossible!

2695
02:01:53,840 --> 02:01:59,960
The big one won't fit — put it this way — ugh!

2696
02:01:59,960 --> 02:02:06,740
Second time with this one — aaaargh!

2697
02:02:06,740 --> 02:02:09,400
That skull went flying over there! lol

2698
02:02:09,400 --> 02:02:10,800
Oh no! lol

2699
02:02:10,800 --> 02:02:12,900
It explodes on the third hit!

2700
02:02:12,900 --> 02:02:14,140
Right, right, exactly!

2701
02:02:14,140 --> 02:02:16,940
It explodes on the third hit, everyone — that thing!

2702
02:02:16,940 --> 02:02:20,740
Good to know~

2703
02:02:20,740 --> 02:02:23,540
Yeah, learned something new~

2704
02:02:23,540 --> 02:02:41,990
Not bad!

2705
02:02:41,990 --> 02:02:47,380
We're all in this together~

2706
02:02:49,380 --> 02:02:51,380
That was scary!

2707
02:02:51,380 --> 02:02:56,680
I collected a bunch!

2708
02:02:56,680 --> 02:02:58,680
Thank you!

2709
02:02:58,680 --> 02:03:00,680
You already put that in earlier, didn't you?

2710
02:03:00,680 --> 02:03:04,880
Yay!

2711
02:03:04,880 --> 02:03:05,880
Wow, amazing!

2712
02:03:05,880 --> 02:03:07,680
That's huge!

2713
02:03:07,680 --> 02:03:08,680
Nice!

2714
02:03:08,680 --> 02:03:09,680
We did it!

2715
02:03:09,680 --> 02:03:10,480
Nice!

2716
02:03:10,480 --> 02:03:12,280
46,000 — incredible!

2717
02:03:12,280 --> 02:03:14,080
Amazing~!

2718
02:03:14,080 --> 02:03:17,080
We're making good money every round!

2719
02:03:17,080 --> 02:03:20,420
Mmm! Sad! We're good! Sad!

2720
02:03:20,420 --> 02:03:22,940
Let's head out again from here!

2721
02:03:22,940 --> 02:03:24,800
Watch out! I almost got squished!

2722
02:03:24,800 --> 02:03:27,540
Okay okay, watch out! Watch out!

2723
02:03:27,540 --> 02:03:30,340
I almost got turned into onion slices!

2724
02:03:30,340 --> 02:03:32,540
Dangerous! Dangerous!

2725
02:03:32,540 --> 02:03:38,140
This one's here, but that one's missing — I want to deliver it somewhere else

2726
02:03:38,140 --> 02:03:39,140
OK

2727
02:03:39,140 --> 02:03:41,970
This is probably the smallest one — can we fit it here?

2728
02:03:41,970 --> 02:03:45,220
What is this? It looks like a yakitori skewer

2729
02:03:45,220 --> 02:03:47,020
Looks like it might move

2730
02:03:47,020 --> 02:03:48,640
You're right

2731
02:03:48,640 --> 02:03:50,440
What even is that thing?

2732
02:03:50,440 --> 02:03:54,040
Whoa, we're definitely going to fall here

2733
02:03:54,040 --> 02:03:57,840
Okaaay

2734
02:03:57,840 --> 02:03:59,840
This place is scary

2735
02:03:59,840 --> 02:04:01,640
This is scary, be careful

2736
02:04:01,640 --> 02:04:05,240
Baby

2737
02:04:05,240 --> 02:04:07,040
Baby

2738
02:04:07,040 --> 02:04:08,840
Everyone grab it together

2739
02:04:08,840 --> 02:04:10,840
Look, baby!

2740
02:04:10,840 --> 02:04:12,440
What the—!?

2741
02:04:12,440 --> 02:04:14,440
Up! Down!

2742
02:04:14,440 --> 02:04:25,470
Up! Down! Down!

2743
02:04:25,470 --> 02:04:26,470
We're okay!

2744
02:04:26,470 --> 02:04:27,470
We did it!

2745
02:04:27,470 --> 02:04:28,470
Yay!

2746
02:04:28,470 --> 02:04:30,470
It's a bit whitish, isn't it

2747
02:04:30,470 --> 02:04:33,220
Like a hot spring egg

2748
02:04:33,220 --> 02:04:36,820
Hot spring

2749
02:04:36,820 --> 02:04:38,670
Hot spring egg~

2750
02:04:38,670 --> 02:04:42,710
What about this one?

2751
02:04:42,710 --> 02:04:44,510
Over there?

2752
02:04:49,720 --> 02:04:51,720
We don't need the small ones

2753
02:04:51,720 --> 02:04:53,820
You know what I mean?

2754
02:04:53,820 --> 02:04:56,820
We have no use for small fry like this

2755
02:04:56,820 --> 02:04:57,920
Right?

2756
02:04:57,920 --> 02:05:00,220
Mine Fujiko would say the same

2757
02:05:00,220 --> 02:05:03,820
Would Mine Fujiko even bother taking the small stuff? Like this

2758
02:05:03,820 --> 02:05:07,120
Like, imagine Mine Fujiko playing REPO

2759
02:05:07,120 --> 02:05:09,320
Wouldn't that be funny?

2760
02:05:09,320 --> 02:05:14,300
She'd never clear it

2761
02:05:14,300 --> 02:05:19,090
This is...

2762
02:05:21,490 --> 02:05:32,200
Yeah, kind of curious about that

2763
02:05:32,200 --> 02:05:34,040
Oh, um, heave-ho

2764
02:05:34,040 --> 02:05:42,940
Heave-ho, here we go!

2765
02:05:42,940 --> 02:05:56,720
Heave-ho, nice!

2766
02:05:56,720 --> 02:06:00,140
Lupin playing REPO... I'd love to see everyone do that

2767
02:06:00,140 --> 02:06:04,740
What is this?

2768
02:06:04,740 --> 02:06:08,320
Tojiko-chan~!

2769
02:06:08,320 --> 02:06:10,320
Hey, can you carry this?

2770
02:06:10,320 --> 02:06:12,390
Sure!

2771
02:06:12,390 --> 02:06:14,390
Where?

2772
02:06:14,390 --> 02:06:20,890
Matsuri-chan, where are you?

2773
02:06:20,890 --> 02:06:26,210
Where'd you go?

2774
02:06:26,210 --> 02:06:30,760
There you are, there you are!

2775
02:06:30,760 --> 02:06:32,560
Skeleton! Skeleton!

2776
02:06:32,560 --> 02:06:34,360
Skeleton's here!

2777
02:06:48,300 --> 02:06:50,100
Alright, smash it!

2778
02:06:50,100 --> 02:06:50,940
Let's go...

2779
02:06:50,940 --> 02:06:52,740
Fight to the last! Glorious death!

2780
02:06:52,740 --> 02:06:53,420
Oh, a foreigner...

2781
02:06:53,420 --> 02:06:55,420
